      "description": "Puts an .srt subtitle file into a video as a subtitle track (viewers can switch it on/off). The video is not re-encoded, so it’s fast and keeps full quality.",
      "mcpDescription": "Add an .srt subtitle file to a video on the user's computer as a selectable subtitle track in a new MP4 (no re-encoding, full quality, fast). Use after transcribe_subtitles when the user wants captions inside the video file.",
      "fields": [
